Follow-up Questions

- How would you test privacy controls and KMS key rotation in production?
- How would you handle a regulatory change requiring tenant-level data deletion and immutability?

## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to build a robust CSV ingestion path with data quality checks, idempotency, and minimal IAM. It exercises deterministic insertIds, error routing, and observable test plans.

## Key Concepts
- Cloud Functions event-driven processing on GCS finalization
- CSV parsing with header normalization and type coercion
- Idempotent BigQuery streaming inserts using insertId
- Error handling: moving invalid files to a dedicated bucket and logging summaries
- IAM least privilege and simple retry/DLQ strategy

